        "height": 176,
        "content": "## Partial-session closing notice\nThis workflow is called only after a partial respondent has used all three reminders and the final 24-hour grace period has expired. It sends the approved `srv_feedback_session_closed` template. The webhook waits for the Meta send node so the application closes the session only after Meta accepts the message."
